{"seq":1,"slug":"training-rerankers","title":"重排器训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/training/training-rerankers","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"重排器训练\">重排器训练</h1><p>为什么 149M 参数的小重排器能追平十倍大的模型？因为重排质量的决定权不在架构、在训练。一个交叉编码器骨架，喂对了数据、选对了损失，能比喂错的高出十几个点。本篇是训练章的总纲：从查询-文档对的监督信号讲起，过一遍 pointwise 与 pairwise 两类最基础的目标函数，再讲训练数据从哪来。负样本挖掘、蒸馏和列表级损失这三个深水区各有专篇，本篇负责把它们串成一张地图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-监督信号与训练范式\">核心概念：监督信号与训练范式</h2><p>重排器训练的原料是三元组：一个查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、若干相关文档（正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、若干不相关文档（负例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。模型要学会给正例打高分、负例打低分。按「一次比较几个文档」分三种范式，复杂度与对齐目标递增。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  DATA[查询 q + 正例 d+ + 负例 d-] --&gt; POINT[Pointwise&lt;br/&gt;单文档打分&lt;br/&gt;二分类/回归]&#10;  DATA --&gt; PAIR[Pairwise&lt;br/&gt;正负成对&lt;br/&gt;学 d+ 分 &gt; d- 分]&#10;  DATA --&gt; LIST[Listwise&lt;br/&gt;整条列表&lt;br/&gt;直接优化排序质量]&#10;  POINT --&gt; M[重排模型 s 比 q,d]&#10;  PAIR --&gt; M&#10;  LIST --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n  DATA[查询 q + 正例 d+ + 负例 d-] --&gt; POINT[Pointwise&lt;br/&gt;单文档打分&lt;br/&gt;二分类/回归]\n  DATA --&gt; PAIR[Pairwise&lt;br/&gt;正负成对&lt;br/&gt;学 d+ 分 &gt; d- 分]\n  DATA --&gt; LIST[Listwise&lt;br/&gt;整条列表&lt;br/&gt;直接优化排序质量]\n  POINT --&gt; M[重排模型 s 比 q,d]\n  PAIR --&gt; M\n  LIST --&gt; M</pre><ul>\n<li>Pointwise（逐点）：把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 当独立样本，标注成相关/不相关（二分类）或相关度分数（回归），用交叉熵或 MSE 训练。最简单，但它学的是「绝对相关度」，与「谁该排前面」的相对目标不完全一致。</li>\n<li>Pairwise（成对）：拿一对正负例，让模型学「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(q,d^+) &gt; s(q,d^-)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」，直接逼近排序的相对本质。RankNet 是其经典形式。</li>\n<li>Listwise（列表）：一次看整条候选列表，直接优化排序指标。它与 <a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">nDCG/MRR</a> 评测目标最对齐，数学最复杂，专门留给 <a href=\"listwise-objectives\">列表级目标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pointwise-最简单的起点\">Pointwise：最简单的起点</h2><p>Pointwise 把重排退化成一个分类/回归问题。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，模型输出分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(q,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，过 sigmoid 得相关概率，用二元交叉熵优化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>point</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{point}}=-\\sum_{(q,d)}\\big[y\\log\\sigma(s(q,d))+(1-y)\\log(1-\\sigma(s(q,d)))\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">point</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 是相关标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 sigmoid。它的好处是实现简单、能用海量「点击=相关」的弱标签。短板是它独立看待每个文档，不知道同一查询下哪个该排前——两篇都判「相关」时它不关心谁更相关。许多生产重排器其实就用 pointwise 训练，靠数据量和好负例（见下文）弥补，效果已经不差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pairwise-与-ranknet-学相对顺序\">Pairwise 与 RankNet：学相对顺序</h2><p>Pairwise 直面排序的相对本质。对同一查询的一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(d^+, d^-)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，定义模型预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 排在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 前的概率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{ij}=\\sigma\\big(s(q,d^+)-s(q,d^-)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>RankNet 用交叉熵把这个概率推向 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>pair</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{pair}}=-\\log\\sigma\\big(s(q,d^+)-s(q,d^-)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉很清楚——只要正例分数比负例高得足够多，损失就趋零；负例反超则重罚。这正是大多数交叉编码器的默认训练损失。Sentence-Transformers 的 CrossEncoder 就内置了这类成对损失（来源：sbert.net 损失文档）。Pairwise 比 pointwise 更对齐排序，但它平等看待所有错位——把第 1、2 名排反和把第 1、50 名排反惩罚一样，而前者其实更致命。修正这一点要靠 LambdaRank 式的「按指标增益加权」，那是 <a href=\"listwise-objectives\">列表级目标</a> 的内容。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>损失</th>\n<th>学什么</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointwise</td>\n<td>交叉熵/MSE</td>\n<td>绝对相关度</td>\n<td>简单、能用弱标签</td>\n<td>不建模相对顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pairwise</td>\n<td>RankNet 式</td>\n<td>成对相对顺序</td>\n<td>对齐排序本质、稳健</td>\n<td>平等对待所有错位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listwise</td>\n<td>ListNet/Lambda</td>\n<td>整条列表质量</td>\n<td>最对齐 nDCG</td>\n<td>复杂、计算重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"训练数据从哪来\">训练数据从哪来</h2><p>再好的损失也救不了烂数据。重排器的训练数据有三个来源。其一，人工标注：质量最高，成本最贵，常用于评测集和少量金标准。其二，公开数据集：MS MARCO（带相关性判断的大规模问答-段落对）是事实标准的起点。其三，弱监督/合成：用点击日志当弱标签（点了=相关），或用强模型合成查询与相关性标签——2025 年大量工作用 LLM 生成查询-文档对及难负样本（如 DocReRank 的单页难负查询生成，arxiv 2505.22584）。合成训练数据的价值与风险见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../synthetic-data-generation/foundations/why-synthetic-data\">为什么用合成数据</a>。</p>\n<p>数据里最关键的一环不是正例而是负例：随机负例太容易、学不到细粒度区分，必须挖「看起来像但其实不相关」的难负例。难负样本挖掘是决定成败的杠杆，独立成篇见 <a href=\"hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[训练数据] --&gt; B[人工标注&lt;br/&gt;金标准 评测用]&#10;  A --&gt; C[公开集 MS MARCO&lt;br/&gt;规模起点]&#10;  A --&gt; D[弱监督 点击日志]&#10;  A --&gt; E[LLM 合成 查询+难负]&#10;  B --&gt; F[训练重排器]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[训练数据] --&gt; B[人工标注&lt;br/&gt;金标准 评测用]\n  A --&gt; C[公开集 MS MARCO&lt;br/&gt;规模起点]\n  A --&gt; D[弱监督 点击日志]\n  A --&gt; E[LLM 合成 查询+难负]\n  B --&gt; F[训练重排器]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"微调一个重排器的最小流程\">微调一个重排器的最小流程</h2><p>落地一个重排器训练通常是这几步：选骨架（小英文场景 BERT/ModernBERT，多语场景 mBERT/XLM-R 或直接微调 <a href=\"../rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers\">开源重排器</a>）→ 备数据（正例 + 挖好的难负例，正负比例常 1:4~1:15）→ 选损失（pairwise RankNet 起步，追求 nDCG 上 listwise）→ 训练 → 在留出集上用 <a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">nDCG/MRR</a> 评估 → 据评估迭代负例与损失。微调比从头训便宜得多，多数团队从一个开源交叉编码器微调起步。LLM 重排器走的是另一条路——靠提示而非训练，或用蒸馏获得，见 <a href=\"../rerankers/llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重排质量由训练而非架构主导：同一骨架，数据与损失对了能高出十几个点。</li>\n<li>三范式按对齐目标递增：pointwise（绝对相关度，最简单）、pairwise（相对顺序，RankNet，交叉编码器默认）、listwise（整条列表，最对齐 nDCG）。</li>\n<li>Pointwise 用二元交叉熵、能吃弱标签；pairwise 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log\\sigma(s^+-s^-)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 学相对顺序，但平等对待所有错位。</li>\n<li>数据三来源（人工/公开 MS MARCO/弱监督与 LLM 合成）；负例质量是关键杠杆，须挖难负例。</li>\n<li>落地多从微调开源交叉编码器起步：选骨架→备难负数据→选损失→训练→nDCG 评估迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> —— 决定成败的数据侧杠杆。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"listwise-objectives\">列表级目标</a> —— 修正 pairwise「平等错位」的损失。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">评测 nDCG/MRR</a> —— 训练好坏的度量。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals/metric-types\">评估指标</a> —— 更广的指标类型背景。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/domain-specific-eval\">领域定制评估</a> —— 为自有领域建评测集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重排器训练","id":"重排器训练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：监督信号与训练范式","id":"核心概念-监督信号与训练范式"},{"level":2,"text":"Pointwise：最简单的起点","id":"pointwise-最简单的起点"},{"level":2,"text":"Pairwise 与 RankNet：学相对顺序","id":"pairwise-与-ranknet-学相对顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"训练数据从哪来","id":"训练数据从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"微调一个重排器的最小流程","id":"微调一个重排器的最小流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 重排器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/rerankers/llm-rerankers"},"next":{"title":"难负样本与蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/training/hard-negatives-distillation"}}